<main class="zd-kindlitt">

  <section class="zdk-hero">
    <div class="zdk-hero__copy">
      <p class="zdk-eyebrow">KindLitt</p>
      <h1>A calmer reading space for deep learning.</h1>
      <p>
        KindLitt is a reading-focused app concept designed for people who want to
        slow down, read more intentionally, and turn books into real understanding.
      </p>

      <div class="zdk-status-chips">
        <span>Reading Tool</span>
        <span>Concept Stage</span>
        <span>Ziyu Ecosystem</span>
      </div>

      <div class="zdk-actions">
        <a href="/pages/support">Support Development</a>
        <a href="/pages/projects">View Projects</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="zdk-hero__visual">
      <img
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDNmmfCsH2wkKIic1auKPW9U9px3FVZtc9LKraKWSOVU6ex-77Ra4N9ArmC91U7voWHzjVAR7GWjxbzDldalUW56ATsYZ4IMMOqj_EvmOVbu7vzE8VmLxzawVN4OENpQegKAN2O6SNzBOGbw7nUEutD7cHFn5nrpqVjPq-89J5cHZcgzT-TKogLWfxOaf8hT-ltJ9uxFx0wxkWMfbPaqTU_N8mz2EcNgX5441KZhjkDI1b8jzr1TDZx2xsdVtV6IrvT0-ZtXbyLc2ro"
        alt="KindLitt reading environment preview"
        width="1000"
        height="900"
      >

      <div class="zdk-floating-note">
        <span>Reading Mode</span>
        <strong>Less scrolling. More understanding.</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdk-intro">
    <p class="zdk-eyebrow">The Problem</p>
    <h2>Reading should not feel like another feed.</h2>
    <p>
      KindLitt is designed around quiet attention. Instead of overwhelming readers
      with noise, streak pressure, or endless recommendations, it creates a calmer
      space for reading, notes, reflection, and retention.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="zdk-grid">
    <article class="zdk-card zdk-card--wide">
      <span>01</span>
      <h3>Read with intention.</h3>
      <p>
        KindLitt is imagined as a focused reading environment where the interface
        fades back and the book, notes, and ideas become the center.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdk-card">
      <span>02</span>
      <h3>Capture what matters.</h3>
      <p>
        Save quotes, thoughts, questions, vocabulary, and insights without breaking
        the rhythm of reading.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdk-card zdk-card--dark">
      <span>03</span>
      <h3>Turn books into growth.</h3>
      <p>
        The goal is not just finishing books. It is understanding, remembering, and
        letting ideas change how you live.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdk-card">
      <span>04</span>
      <h3>Designed for deep work.</h3>
      <p>
        KindLitt fits the Ziyu mission: calmer digital tools that support real-life
        learning, reflection, and focus.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="zdk-flow">
    <div class="zdk-section-head">
      <p class="zdk-eyebrow">How It Could Work</p>
      <h2>A gentle reading loop.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="zdk-flow-list">
      <article>
        <span>Step 01</span>
        <h3>Choose what to read.</h3>
        <p>Start with a book, article, scripture, essay, or learning resource.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Step 02</span>
        <h3>Read in a calmer space.</h3>
        <p>Use a simple focused interface designed to reduce distractions.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Step 03</span>
        <h3>Save the insight.</h3>
        <p>Capture notes, quotes, vocabulary, and thoughts as you read.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Step 04</span>
        <h3>Review and apply.</h3>
        <p>Return to what you learned and connect ideas to real goals and life.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdk-status">
    <div>
      <p class="zdk-eyebrow">Project Status</p>
      <h2>KindLitt is part of the future Ziyu ecosystem.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is the main project being built right now. KindLitt is a future
        reading and learning tool concept connected to the same mission of intentional
        technology.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="zdk-status-list">
      <article>
        <span>Concept</span>
        <h3>Reading sanctuary</h3>
        <p>A calm space for reading, notes, highlights, and reflection.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Future</span>
        <h3>Learning archive</h3>
        <p>A system for saving insights and connecting books to real growth.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Connected</span>
        <h3>Ziyu ecosystem</h3>
        <p>Designed to support Goal Grower, MyJourney, Blokkr, and future apps.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdk-cta">
    <p class="zdk-eyebrow">Support the Mission</p>
    <h2>Help build tools for deeper reading and better focus.</h2>
    <p>
      Support Ziyu Development, follow the roadmap, or join the community as projects
      move from concept to real products.
    </p>

    <div class="zdk-actions">
      <a href="/pages/support">Support Development</a>
      <a href="/pages/community">Join the Community</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

